<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλῐγό-της</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλῆθος</span> in all senses : <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>fewness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				678c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				984a10
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				101(102).23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				20
			</span></i> ; <i>fewness of rulers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1279b27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>smallness, scantiness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				591e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				745d
			</span></i> ; of food, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				456
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of Time,
				<i>shortness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				158d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>feebleness</i> of voice, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.145
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
